# ============================================================================
#  Project Amphoreus — Senses model selection (.env)
#  Loaded automatically by src/core/llm_client.py and src/core/senses.py
#  (python-dotenv). The launcher launch_sanctuary.cmd can also force a mode
#  via SENSES_MODE (unified | quality) — see the block at the bottom.
#
#  CHOOSE ONE OPTION: uncomment exactly one block below. The .env is
#  authoritative (loaded with override=True). launch_sanctuary.cmd's
#  SENSES_MODE variable re-applies on top of .env (unified | quality).
#
#  NOTE (verified 2026-08-11 against the Ollama registry): qwen3-omni is NOT
#  available on Ollama; gemma3n's correct tag is the bare "gemma3n" (latest =
#  8B E2B, ~7.5 GB, text+image+audio+video).
# ============================================================================

# --- Option A — UNIFIED (recommended): ONE model hears music AND sees pictures
#     gemma3n (8B E2B: text + image + audio + video) — a single ~7.5 GB footprint
#     instead of loading two separate 6 GB models. Best for the 31.4 GB RAM box.
VISION_MODEL=gemma3n
AUDIO_MODEL=gemma3n

# --- Option B — MAX QUALITY PER CHANNEL: comment Option A, uncomment this
#     vision = qwen3-vl:8b  (best-in-class vision-language model, 6.1 GB)
#     audio  = gemma3n      (newest audio-capable model; qwen2.5-omni is the
#                            installed fallback for music perception)
# VISION_MODEL=qwen3-vl:8b
# AUDIO_MODEL=gemma3n
